WEBVTT

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:02.449
Where does RNA polymerase start reading?

00:00:03.169 --> 00:00:04.086
Not just anywhere.

00:00:04.306 --> 00:00:05.502
It starts at the promoter.

00:00:06.129 --> 00:00:07.406
The promoter is a stretch of the

00:00:07.464 --> 00:00:09.055
gene that marks the start.

00:00:09.682 --> 00:00:12.259
RNA polymerase makes first contact right here.

00:00:12.712 --> 00:00:14.721
The promoter also sets the direction.

00:00:15.347 --> 00:00:16.590
So reading goes this way.

00:00:17.217 --> 00:00:18.656
Like a start line that also shows

00:00:18.761 --> 00:00:19.678
which way to run.

00:00:20.305 --> 00:00:22.720
The promoter is where RNA polymerase starts,

00:00:22.940 --> 00:00:24.206
and it sets which way the gene

00:00:24.241 --> 00:00:24.728
is read.

00:00:25.123 --> 00:00:25.831
Swipe.
